<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
  <head>
    <title><%= [ content_for(:title), "Privacy Genie" ].compact.join(" · ") %></title>
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
    <meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-capable" content="yes">
    <meta name="application-name" content="Privacy Genie">
    <meta name="mobile-web-app-capable" content="yes">
    <meta name="color-scheme" content="light dark">
    <%= csrf_meta_tags %>
    <%= csp_meta_tag %>

    <%= yield :head %>

    <%# Enable PWA manifest for installable apps (make sure to enable in config/routes.rb too!) %>
    <%#= tag.link rel: "manifest", href: pwa_manifest_path(format: :json) %>

    <link rel="icon" href="/icon.png" type="image/png">
    <link rel="icon" href="/icon.svg" type="image/svg+xml">
    <link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/icon.png">

    <%# Tailwind 빌드 결과(app/assets/builds/tailwind.css)를 넣는다. 원본은 app/assets/tailwind/application.css %>
    <%= stylesheet_link_tag :app, "data-turbo-track": "reload" %>
    <%= javascript_importmap_tags %>
  </head>

  <body class="min-h-screen bg-stone-50 font-sans leading-7 break-keep wrap-anywhere text-stone-900 dark:bg-stone-950 dark:text-stone-100">
    <header class="border-b border-stone-200 bg-white dark:border-stone-800 dark:bg-stone-900">
      <div class="mx-auto flex max-w-6xl flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-3 gap-y-1 px-4 py-3">
        <%= link_to "Privacy Genie", root_path, class: "text-lg font-bold text-stone-900 no-underline dark:text-stone-100" %>
        <span class="text-sm text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-400">개인정보 보호법·시행령 근거 답변</span>
      </div>
    </header>

    <p class="site-notice mx-auto mt-3 max-w-6xl px-4 text-sm text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-400">
      법률 자문이 아닌 일반 정보입니다. 이름·연락처·주민등록번호 같은 개인정보는 질문에 넣지 마세요.
    </p>

    <%= yield %>

    <footer class="mx-auto mt-12 mb-8 max-w-6xl px-4 text-[13px] text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400">
      답변은 AI가 법령 조문을 근거로 만든 참고 정보이며 틀릴 수 있습니다. 중요한 결정은 원문 조문과 전문가 상담으로 확인하세요.
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>
